 "summary": "A cut whose outline is exactly the flat top face left inside a fillet failed on SolidCraft's truck kernel (#4829; also #10422 and #3968). An r 10 post 40 tall has its top circle rounded r 2, leaving a flat top of radius 8; that top face is cut 14 down. As the face's own prism (sweep_face) and as an r 8 cylinder, whose wall meets the round exactly along the top face's edge.",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "prism_of_the_top_face",
   "note": "The rounded top face swept 14 down (sweep_face) and cut.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "op": "cylinder",
     "id": "post",
     "origin": [
      0,
      0,
      0
     ],
     "axis": [
      0,
      0,
      1
     ],
     "radius": 10,
     "height": 40
    },
    {
     "op": "fillet",
     "id": "rounded",
     "body": "post",
     "edges": [
      [
       10,
       0,
       40
      ]
     ],
     "radius": 2
    },
    {
     "op": "sweep_face",
     "id": "tool",
     "body": "rounded",
     "face": [
      0,
      0,
      40
     ],
     "direction": [
      0,
      0,
      -1
     ],
     "distance": 14
    },
    {
     "op": "difference",
     "id": "result",
     "a": "rounded",
     "b": "tool"
    }
   ],
   "expect": {
    "lumps": 1,
    "volume": {
     "value": 9699.977756920827,
     "tol": 0.0001,
     "formula": "pi*10^2*40 - (1 - pi/4)*2^2 * 2*pi*(10 - c) - pi*8^2*14, c = 2*(10 - 3*pi)/(3*(4 - pi))"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "cylinder_on_the_top_face_edge",
